   touchstone requires:  free FALSE / 2D YM TRUE / M6 FALSE / plaquette n/a
   target delivers    :  FALSE / FALSE / FALSE(inf, TRUE per-mode) / n/a
   => no false positive on free field or on M6 (the acid test passes)
